OL,3,AJames Nelson-Joyce hits back at mayor's
OL,4,ATV drama criticism
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis City Is Ours actor James
OL,7,FNelson-Joyce said he is "proud" of the
OL,8,FLiverpool-based show and has defended
OL,9,Fit following criticism from the city
OL,10,Fregion's mayor.
OL,12,FEarlier this month Steve Rotheram said
OL,13,Fhe would like TV dramas set in his home
OL,14,Fcity to focus on the "warmth" of the
OL,15,Fpeople, rather than "drugs, organised
OL,16,Fcrime and criminal activity".
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
